@baseUrl=http://localhost:8787/movements

# (name, difficulty, description, extraNotes)

### create new movement
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### get "published" movements
GET {{baseUrl}}

### get all movements (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### get movement by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/put mongodb movement id here

